#. module: holiday_house
#: model:ir.ui.view,website_meta_title:holiday_house.view_page_activities
msgid "Nature Activities and Forest Hikes | Wood Haven - Your Wild Escape"
msgstr ""
"ກິດຈະກຳທຳມະຊາດ ແລະ ການຍ່າງປ່າ | Wood Haven - ການພັກຜ່ອນທ່າມກາງທຳມະຊາດຂອງທ່ານ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:holiday_house.product_template_12
msgid ""
"Nestled at the edge of wide open fields and a magical forest, this charming "
"hobbit house offers an enchanting stay in nature. With its earth-sheltered "
"design and cozy interior, it’s the perfect hideaway for those seeking peace, "
"simplicity, and a touch of fantasy."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຢູ່ແຄມທົ່ງກວ້າງ ແລະ ປ່າໄມ້ອັນມີສະເໜ່, "
"ເຮືອນຮັອບບິດຫຼັງງາມນີ້ມອບປະສົບການພັກຜ່ອນທ່າມກາງທຳມະຊາດທີ່ແສນປະທັບໃຈ. "
"ດ້ວຍການອອກແບບທີ່ກົມກືນກັບພື້ນດິນ ແລະ ພາຍໃນທີ່ອົບອຸ່ນ, "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນບ່ອນພັກຜ່ອນທີ່ສົມບູນແບບສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ຊອກຫາຄວາມສະຫງົບ, ຄວາມລຽບງ່າຍ ແລະ ກິ່ນອາຍແຫ່ງຈິນຕະນາການ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:holiday_house.product_template_16
msgid ""
"Nestled in the heart of a dense fir forest, this cabin is the ultimate "
"sanctuary of privacy. Built with raw timber logs and a slate roof, it "
"invites total disconnection to the sound of the wind in the pine needles."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຢູ່ທ່າມກາງດົງສົນອັນຂຽວອຸ່ມທຸ່ມ, ຕູບໄມ້ຫຼັງນີ້ຄືບ່ອນພັກຜ່ອນສ່ວນຕົວທີ່ສົມບູນແບບ. ສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍໄມ້ທ່ອນທຳມະຊາດ ແ"
"ລະ ຫຼັງຄາກະເບື້ອງຫີນກາບ, ພ້ອມໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັດຂາດຈາກຄວາມວຸ້ນວາຍພາຍນອກ ເພື່ອຮັບຟັງສຽງສາຍລົມພັດຜ່ານໃບສົນ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:holiday_house.product_template_11
msgid "No refund on no-show."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການສົ່ງເງິນຄືນໃນກໍລະນີບໍ່ມາຕາມກຳນົດ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Now that you have several companies or branches, you may want some of your "
"employees to access only to some of them in case they always work in some of "
"your places."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານມີຫຼາຍບໍລິສັດ ຫຼື ສາຂາແລ້ວ, "
"ທ່ານອາດຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ພະນັກງານບາງຄົນເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສະເພາະບາງບ່ອນເທົ່ານັ້ນ "
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຂົາເຈົ້າເຮັດວຽກປະຈຳຢູ່ບາງສະຖານທີ່."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Odoo offers you infinite possibilities, such as:"
msgstr "Odoo ມອບຄວາມເປັນໄປໄດ້ຢ່າງບໍ່ຈຳກັດໃຫ້ແກ່ທ່ານ ເຊັ່ນ:"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Of course, this is just an overview of the features included in this "
"package. Feel free to add new apps, delete/modify demo data, and test "
"everything around!"
msgstr ""
"ແນ່ນອນ, ນີ້ເປັນພຽງພາບລວມຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ມີໃນແພັກເກດນີ້. ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມແອັບໃໝ່, ລຶບ ຫຼື "
"ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງ, ແລະ ທົດລອງໃຊ້ງານທຸກຢ່າງໄດ້ຕາມໃຈ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"On a daily basis, house keeping tasks are created depending on the current "
"stays and assigned to employees that have house keeping shifts."
msgstr ""
"ໃນແຕ່ລະວັນ, ວຽກງານແມ່ບ້ານຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອີງຕາມການພັກເຊົາໃນປະຈຸບັນ ແລະ "
"ຖືກມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ແກ່ພະນັກງານທີ່ມີກະວຽກແມ່ບ້ານ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "On a resource to block line, click, drag and drop to create a slot."
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງແຖວຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການປິດກັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ກົດ, ລາກ ແລະ ວາງ ເພື່ອສ້າງຊ່ອງເວລາ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "On top of guest and stay management, you need to keep the place clean!"
msgstr "ນອກເໜືອຈາກການຄຸ້ມຄອງແຂກ ແລະ ການພັກເຊົາແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງຮັກສາສະຖານທີ່ໃຫ້ສະອາດຢູ່ສະເໝີ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Once confirmed, the payment is done and the order booked seamlessly!"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ, ການຊຳລະເງິນຈະສຳເລັດ ແລະ ການຈອງຈະຖືກບັນທຶກຢ່າງຄ່ອງຕົວ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once defined, you can switch between companies or branches from the company "
"selector at the top right of your screen.<br/>This will expose depending on "
"where you are, only the selected companies and branches data."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອກຳນົດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງບໍລິສັດ ຫຼື ສາຂາ ຈາກບ່ອນເລືອກບໍລິສັດຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ.<br/"
">ລະບົບຈະສະແດງສະເພາະຂໍ້ມູນຂອງບໍລິສັດ ແລະ ສາຂາທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ໂດຍອີງຕາມສະຖານະທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Once done, loggin as a portal user."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ປະຕູເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Portal)."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open a house page from the website and scroll down to the Customer Reviews "
"section."
msgstr "ເປີດໜ້າເຮືອນພັກຈາກເວັບໄຊ ແລ້ວເລື່ອນລົງໄປຫາພາກສ່ວນ ຄຳຕິຊົມຂອງລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open now, the Tasks from the accommodation app, House Keeping menu.<br/>This "
"is\n"
"                the daily list of house keeping tasks to be tackled."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້, ເປີດໜ້າວຽກ (Tasks) ຈາກແອັບບ່ອນພັກ, ເມນູ ວຽກແມ່ບ້ານ (House Keeping).<br/>ນີ້ຄື\n"
"                ລາຍການວຽກແມ່ບ້ານປະຈຳວັນທີ່ຕ້ອງດຳເນີນການ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>Settings App</strong> and reach the companies from the menu "
"Users &amp; Companies."
msgstr "ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ</strong> ແລ້ວເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ບໍລິສັດ ຈາກເມນູ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ &amp; ບໍລິສັດ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>Settings App</strong> and reach the users from the menu "
"Users &amp; Companies."
msgstr "ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ</strong> ແລ້ວເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຈາກເມນູ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ &amp; ບໍລິສັດ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the <strong>Website App</strong> and navigate to the Houses."
msgstr "ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບເວັບໄຊ</strong> ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ ເຮືອນພັກ (Houses)."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Board from the accommodation app, House Keeping menu.<br/>Here you "
"have an\n"
"                overview of the cleanness state of your resources."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດກະດານ (Board) ຈາກແອັບບ່ອນພັກ, ເມນູ ວຽກແມ່ບ້ານ.<br/>ບ່ອນນີ້ທ່ານຈະເຫັນ\n"
"                ພາບລວມຂອງສະຖານະຄວາມສະອາດຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Default pricelist from the configuration menu."
msgstr "ເປີດ ຕາຕະລາງລາຄາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຈາກເມນູການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Default pricelist to see the existing price rules which apply to it."
msgstr "ເປີດຕາຕະລາງລາຄາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງກົດເກນລາຄາທີ່ມີຢູ່ ເຊິ່ງນຳໃຊ້ກັບຕາຕະລາງນີ້."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Holiday House App and navigate to the Configuration / Leaves menu."
msgstr "ເປີດແອັບເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດ ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ເມນູ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ / ການລາພັກ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Holiday House App and then navigate to the orders from the menu."
msgstr "ເປີດແອັບເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດ ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ເມນູໃບສັ່ງ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Holiday<strong/> House App to appreciate the currently planned "
"bookings with the Schedule."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດແອັບເຮືອນພັກ<strong/>ຕາກອາກາດ "
"ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງການຈອງທີ່ໄດ້ວາງແຜນໄວ້ໃນປະຈຸບັນຜ່ານຕາຕະລາງເວລາ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Planning from the accommodation app, House Keeping menu.<br/>\n"
"                There you can create shifts for house keeping duties and "
"assign employees."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ ແຜນງານ (Planning) ຈາກແອັບບ່ອນພັກ, ເມນູ ວຽກແມ່ບ້ານ.<br/>\n"
"                ຢູ່ບ່ອນນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງກະວຽກສຳລັບໜ້າທີ່ແມ່ບ້ານ ແລະ ມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ພະນັກງານໄດ້."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Pricelists from the <strong>Holiday House App</strong>, "
"Configuration / Pricelists menu."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ ຕາຕະລາງລາຄາ ຈາກ <strong>ແອັບເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດ</strong>, ເມນູ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ / "
"ຕາຕະລາງລາຄາ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Settings App and navigate to the Rental section or search for "
"\"Unavailability days\"."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດແອັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ພາກສ່ວນ ການເຊົ່າ (Rental) ຫຼື ຄົ້ນຫາຄຳວ່າ \"Unavailability "
"days\"."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Steering menu and select Availability."
msgstr "ເປີດເມນູ Steering ແລ້ວເລືອກ ຄວາມພ້ອມໃຫ້ບໍລິການ (Availability)."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Steering menu and select Occupancy."
msgstr "ເປີດເມນູ Steering ແລ້ວເລືອກ ອັດຕາການເຂົ້າພັກ (Occupancy)."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Survey App to find the customer satisfaction survey."
msgstr "ເປີດແອັບແບບສຳຫຼວດ ເພື່ອຊອກຫາແບບສຳຫຼວດຄວາມເພິ່ງພໍໃຈຂອງລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Taxes from the <strong>Invoicing App</strong>, under the "
"Configuration / Accounting menu."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ ອາກອນ ຈາກ <strong>ແອັບໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນ</strong>, ພາຍໃຕ້ເມນູ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ / ບັນຊີ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the door for more custom workflows and actions with the power of "
"<strong>Studio App</strong>."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໂອກາດສູ່ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກ ແລະ ການດຳເນີນງານທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ດ້ວຍປະສິດທິພາບຂອງ "
"<strong>ແອັບ Studio</strong>."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the guest order."
msgstr "ເປີດໃບສັ່ງຂອງແຂກ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the order of you just arrived guests."
msgstr "ເປີດໃບສັ່ງຂອງແຂກທີ່ຫາກໍມາຮອດ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open your guest order from the Holiday House App."
msgstr "ເປີດໃບສັ່ງຂອງແຂກຈາກແອັບເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Optimizing weekly turnover to maximize occupancy during peak season, you can "
"align your bookings to a weekly rental pattern (e.g., Saturday to Saturday). "
"By restricting check-ins and check-outs to specific days, you synchronize "
"your housekeeping and eliminate calendar gaps."
msgstr ""
"ການເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບຮອບວຽນການພັກແບບລາຍອາທິດ ເພື່ອເພີ່ມອັດຕາການເຂົ້າພັກໃຫ້ສູງສຸດໃນຊ່ວງລະດູທ່ອງທ່ຽວ, "
"ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດການຈອງໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັບຮູບແບບການເຊົ່າລາຍອາທິດ (ເຊັ່ນ: ວັນເສົາ ຫາ ວັນເສົາ). "
"ໂດຍການຈຳກັດການແຈ້ງເຂົ້າພັກ ແລະ ແຈ້ງອອກສະເພາະວັນທີ່ກຳນົດ, "
"ທ່ານຈະສາມາດປະສານງານວຽກແມ່ບ້ານໄດ້ຢ່າງລົງຕົວ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຊ່ອງຫວ່າງໃນປະຕິທິນ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.view_page_contactus
msgid "Other"
msgstr "ອື່ນໆ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.view_page_home
msgid "Our cabins •"
msgstr "ຕູບໄມ້ຂອງພວກເຮົາ •"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:holiday_house.product_template_17
msgid ""
"Perched on a rocky ridge, this modern-rustic cabin overlooks the canopy and "
"offers an infinite panoramic view across the estate. Its architecture blends "
"corten steel, glass, and torrefied wood for a striking, luxurious contrast."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຢູ່ເທິງສັນຫີນ, ຕູບໄມ້ແບບໂມເດີນປະສົມປະສານຄວາມລຽບງ່າຍຫຼັງນີ້ ແນມເຫັນຍອດໄມ້ ແລະ ມອບວິວທິວທັດແບບພາ"
"ໂນຣາມາອັນກວ້າງໄກທົ່ວພື້ນທີ່. ການອອກແບບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳໄດ້ປະສົມປະສານເຫຼັກ Corten, ແກ້ວ ແລະ ໄມ້ອົບ"
"ຄວາມຮ້ອນ ເພື່ອສ້າງຄວາມໂດດເດັ່ນ ແລະ ຫຼູຫຼາຢ່າງລົງຕົວ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Plan, check in and and check out bookings with the <strong>Holiday House "
"App</strong>"
msgstr ""
"ວາງແຜນ, ແຈ້ງເຂົ້າພັກ ແລະ ແຈ້ງອອກການຈອງ ດ້ວຍ <strong>ແອັບເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດ</strong>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.view_page_wellness
msgid ""
"Please provide 24-hour notice should you need to cancel an appointment. The "
"full cost of services will be charged for cancellations within 24 hours or "
"no-show appointments."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາແຈ້ງລ່ວງໜ້າ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງ ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຍົກເລີກການນັດໝາຍ. ການຍົກເລີກພາຍໃນ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງ ຫຼື ກາ"
"ນບໍ່ມາຕາມນັດ ຈະຖືກຄິດຄ່າບໍລິການເຕັມຈຳນວນ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.view_page_restaurant
msgid "Portrait of Chef Aurèle Vanhove"
msgstr "ຮູບຄົນຂອງ ພໍ່ຄົວ Aurèle Vanhove"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Prevent bookings year in advance"
msgstr "ປ້ອງກັນການຈອງລ່ວງໜ້າເປັນປີ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Promote your offers through the <strong>Website App</strong>"
msgstr "ໂຄສະນາຂໍ້ສະເໜີຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານ <strong>ແອັບເວັບໄຊ</strong>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.view_page_home
msgid ""
"Rare cabins and unusual stays set on the hillside. Open all year, never more "
"than one party at a time."
msgstr ""
"ຕູບໄມ້ທີ່ຫາຍາກ ແລະ ບ່ອນພັກແບບພິເສດຕັ້ງຢູ່ເທິງເນີນເຂົາ. ເປີດບໍລິການຕະຫຼອດປີ, ຮັບແຂກພຽງເທື່ອລະໜຶ່ງກຸ່ມເທົ່າ"
"ນັ້ນ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Reach us"
msgstr "ຕິດຕໍ່ພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Record guest identity"
msgstr "ບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງແຂກ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Recording the guest attendance is an obligation in numerous countries."
msgstr "ການບັນທຶກການເຂົ້າພັກຂອງແຂກແມ່ນພັນທະທາງກົດໝາຍໃນຫຼາຍໆ ປະເທດ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model:website.page,name:holiday_house.page_restaurant
msgid "Restaurant"
msgstr "ຮ້ານອາຫານ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.view_page_contactus
msgid "Restaurant Reservations"
msgstr "ການຈອງໂຕະຮ້ານອາຫານ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.view_page_home
msgid "Restaurant •"
msgstr "ຮ້ານອາຫານ •"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.footer_custom
msgid "SITEMAP"
msgstr "ແຜນຜັງເວັບໄຊ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.view_page_wellness
msgid "Seasonal specials"
msgstr "ລາຍການພິເສດຕາມລະດູການ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"See that for demo purpose we setup typical uplift and discount rules to "
"adjust your prices during key periods."
msgstr ""
"ສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າ ສຳລັບຈຸດປະສົງການສາທິດ ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າກົດເກນການຂຶ້ນລາຄາ ແລະ ສ່ວນຫຼຸດທົ່ວໄປ "
"ເພື່ອປັບລາຄາຂອງທ່ານໃນຊ່ວງເວລາສຳຄັນ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "See that it contains a rule booking blocker setting price to 0."
msgstr "ສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າມັນມີກົດເກນປິດກັ້ນການຈອງ ໂດຍກຳນົດລາຄາເປັນ 0."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.view_page_contactus
msgid "Select a subject"
msgstr "ເລືອກຫົວຂໍ້"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Select one of your employee."
msgstr "ເລືອກພະນັກງານຂອງທ່ານຄົນໃດໜຶ່ງ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Select or create a customer and then confirm the booking!"
msgstr "ເລືອກ ຫຼື ສ້າງລູກຄ້າ ແລ້ວກົດຢືນຢັນການຈອງ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Selling local products? Use the <strong>Point of Sales App </strong>for easy "
"sales."
msgstr ""
"ຂາຍສິນຄ້າທ້ອງຖິ່ນບໍ່? ໃຊ້ <strong>ແອັບຈຸດຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານ (POS) </strong>ເພື່ອການຂາຍທີ່ສະດວກສະບາຍ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.view_page_activities
msgid ""
"Set out to conquer our immense pine forest. Take to the skies on our "
"dizzying treetop adventure course, race down wild trails on an electric "
"mountain bike, or rev your engines during an off-road SSV buggy exploration. "
"For moments of intense connection, challenge your loved ones on our unique "
"padel court, nestled right at the edge of the woods."
msgstr ""
"ອອກເດີນທາງເພື່ອສຳຫຼວດດົງສົນອັນກວ້າງໃຫຍ່ໄພສານ. ສຳຜັດຄວາມຕື່ນເຕັ້ນເທິງຍອດໄມ້ກັບກິດຈະກຳຜະຈົນໄພ, ຂີ່ລົດ"
"ຖີບໄຟຟ້າເທິງເສັ້ນທາງທຳມະຊາດ, ຫຼື ຂັບລົດບັກກີ້ SSV ແບບອອບໂຣດ (Off-road). ສຳລັບຊ່ວງເວລາແຫ່ງຄວາ"
"ມຜູກພັນ, ຮ່ວມຫຼິ້ນກິລາພາເດວ (Padel) ກັບຄົນທີ່ທ່ານຮັກ ໃນສະໜາມພິເສດທີ່ຕັ້ງຢູ່ແຄມປ່າ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:holiday_house.product_template_15
msgid ""
"Set right at the water's edge, this single-story cabin offers direct contact "
"with the great lake. Its solid cedar construction and vast picture windows "
"erase the boundary between the warm interior and the surrounding nature, "
"ideal for those who love the reflections of dawn on the water."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຢູ່ແຄມນ້ຳ, ຕູບໄມ້ຊັ້ນດຽວຫຼັງນີ້ມອບການສຳຜັດກັບທະເລສາບໃຫຍ່ຢ່າງໃກ້ຊິດ. ໂຄງສ້າງໄມ້ຊີດາທີ່ແຂງແກ່ນ ແລະ ປ່"
"ອງຢ້ຽມແກ້ວຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ ເຮັດໃຫ້ພາຍໃນທີ່ອົບອຸ່ນ ແລະ ທຳມະຊາດອ້ອມຮອບກົມກືນກັນ, ເໝາະສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ມັກຊົມແສງອາ"
"ລຸນສະທ້ອນເທິງຜືນນ້ຳ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Setup company or branch specific offers when relevant."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ສະເໜີສະເພາະຂອງບໍລິສັດ ຫຼື ສາຂາຕາມຄວາມເໝາະສົມ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Share your stay offers across your companies and branches (default behavior);"
msgstr "ແບ່ງປັນຂໍ້ສະເໜີບ່ອນພັກຂອງທ່ານໄປທົ່ວທຸກບໍລິສັດ ແລະ ສາຂາ (ຮູບແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ);"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Simply open the Dashboard App to land on the Performance dashboard."
msgstr "ພຽງແຕ່ເປີດ ແອັບແຜງຄວບຄຸມ (Dashboard) ເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ໜ້າແຜງຄວບຄຸມປະສິດທິພາບ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.view_page_home
msgid ""
"Sip craft cocktails in your own personal cabana, or settle in at one of our "
"intimate dining tables for a multi-course journey. With a nod toward "
"Hemingway’s Havana, The Canal Club serves up Caribbean-inspired classics "
"with a contemporary twist."
msgstr ""
"ຈິບຄັອກເທວພິເສດໃນຕູບສ່ວນຕົວຂອງທ່ານ, ຫຼື ນັ່ງຮັບປະທານອາຫານແບບຄົບຊຸດທີ່ໂຕະອາຫານສຸດອົບອຸ່ນ. ດ້ວຍກິ່ນອາຍ"
"ແບບ Havana ຂອງ Hemingway, The Canal Club ພ້ອມເສີບອາຫານຄລາດສິກແບບຄາຣິບບຽນ ທີ່ຜະສົມຜະສ"
"ານຄວາມທັນສະໄໝຢ່າງລົງຕົວ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model:ir.actions.server,name:holiday_house.soft_dependency_server_action
msgid "Soft dependency"
msgstr "ຄວາມຂຶ້ນຕໍ່ກັນແບບຍືດຍຸ່ນ (Soft dependency)"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.view_page_contactus
msgid "Spa Reservations"
msgstr "ການຈອງສະປາ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model:product.template,website_meta_description:holiday_house.product_template_15
msgid ""
"Stay at The Shoreline Lodge, a beautiful solid cedar cabin set right at the "
"water's edge. Enjoy panoramic views over the great lake and a warm interior "
"that blends into the surrounding nature at Wood Haven."
msgstr ""
"ພັກຜ່ອນທີ່ The Shoreline Lodge, ຕູບໄມ້ຊີດາອັນສວຍງາມທີ່ຕັ້ງຢູ່ແຄມນ້ຳ. ເພີດເພີນກັບວິວທິວທັດແບບພາໂນຣາ"
"ມາຂອງທະເລສາບໃຫຍ່ ແລະ ບັນຍາກາດພາຍໃນທີ່ອົບອຸ່ນ ເຊິ່ງກົມກືນກັບທຳມະຊາດອ້ອມຕົວທີ່ Wood Haven."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model:product.template,website_meta_description:holiday_house.product_template_16
msgid ""
"Stay at The Timber Retreat, an authentic raw timber cabin nestled in the "
"heart of a fir forest. Enjoy total disconnection and exceptional privacy in "
"this natural sanctuary at Wood Haven."
msgstr ""
"ພັກຜ່ອນທີ່ The Timber Retreat, ຕູບໄມ້ທຳມະຊາດແທ້ໆ ທີ່ຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃຈກາງດົງສົນ. ເພີດເພີນກັບການຕັດຂາດຈາກຄ"
"ວາມວຸ້ນວາຍ ແລະ ຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວທີ່ໂດດເດັ່ນໃນສະຖານທີ່ພັກຜ່ອນທຳມະຊາດທີ່ Wood Haven."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Still from their Rental Order, open the Guests tab."
msgstr "ຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນໜ້າໃບສັ່ງເຊົ່າ (Rental Order), ໃຫ້ເປີດແຖບ ແຂກ (Guests)."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:holiday_house.product_template_14
msgid ""
"Suspended above the shoreline, this beach house offers sweeping views of the "
"sea and sky. The raw beauty of the landscape meets minimalist comfort, "
"creating an unforgettable retreat where nature feels close, powerful, and "
"ever-present."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງໂດດເດັ່ນຢູ່ເໜືອແນວຊາຍຝັ່ງ, ເຮືອນພັກແຄມຫາດຊາຍຫຼັງນີ້ມອບວິວທິວທັດອັນກວ້າງໃຫຍ່ຂອງທະເລ ແລະ ທ້ອງຟ້າ. "
"ຄວາມງົດງາມຕາມທຳມະຊາດປະສານກັບຄວາມສະດວກສະບາຍແບບລຽບງ່າຍ, ສ້າງສະຖານທີ່ພັກຜ່ອນທີ່ໜ້າຈົດຈຳ "
"ເຊິ່ງທຳມະຊາດຢູ່ໃກ້ຊິດ, ຊົງພະລັງ ແລະ ໂອບລ້ອມທ່ານຢູ່ສະເໝີ."

