#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:holiday_house.product_template_19
msgid ""
"The most spacious of the Wood Haven cabins, designed for families or groups "
"of friends. With its cathedral ceilings and majestic volumes, it's a true "
"private lodge combining conviviality and great luxury."
msgstr ""
"ຕູບໄມ້ທີ່ກວ້າງຂວາງທີ່ສຸດຂອງ Wood Haven, ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບຄອບຄົວ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມເພື່ອນຝູງ. ດ້ວຍເພດານສູງໂປ່ງ ແ"
"ລະ ພື້ນທີ່ອັນໂອ່ໂຖງ, ນີ້ຄືເຮືອນພັກສ່ວນຕົວທີ່ປະສົມປະສານຄວາມອົບອຸ່ນເປັນກັນເອງ ແລະ ຄວາມຫຼູຫຼາຢ່າງແທ້ຈິງ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The strength of Odoo is to separate the accounting and many other aspects "
"which are company dependent!"
msgstr "ຈຸດເດັ່ນຂອງ Odoo ແມ່ນການແຍກວຽກບັນຊີ ແລະ ດ້ານອື່ນໆ ອີກຫຼາຍຢ່າງ ທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບແຕ່ລະບໍລິສັດ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The tasks are assigned to balance cleaning points from the stay offers "
"within employees assigned to the associated house keeping role."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າວຽກຕ່າງໆ ຖືກມອບໝາຍເພື່ອສ້າງຄວາມສົມດຸນຂອງຄະແນນການອະນາໄມ ຈາກຂໍ້ສະເໜີບ່ອນພັກ "
"ໃຫ້ແກ່ພະນັກງານທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ຮັບຜິດຊອບໜ້າທີ່ແມ່ບ້ານ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.view_page_restaurant
msgid ""
"The true beating heart of the estate, our bar welcomes you into an intimate "
"setting where natural stone meets solid wood. Take a seat at the counter or "
"sink into our cozy lounge chairs by the lake to discover a creative mixology "
"menu inspired by the scents of the forest. Let our sommelier guide you "
"through our impressive, warmly lit wine cave, featuring rare and exceptional "
"bottles perfect for extending the magic of the evening."
msgstr ""
"ສູນລວມຫົວໃຈຫຼັກຂອງສະຖານທີ່, ບາຣ໌ຂອງພວກເຮົາຍິນດີຕ້ອນຮັບທ່ານສູ່ບັນຍາກາດອັນອົບອຸ່ນທີ່ຫີນທຳມະຊາດປະສານກັບໄ"
"ມ້ແທ້. ນັ່ງທີ່ເຄົາເຕີ ຫຼື ເອນກາຍເທິງຕັ່ງໂຊຟາແຄມນ້ຳ ເພື່ອລອງເມນູເຄື່ອງດື່ມສ້າງສັນທີ່ໄດ້ແຮງບັນດານໃຈຈາກກິ່ນອາ"
"ຍຂອງປ່າໄມ້. ໃຫ້ຊ່ຽວຊານດ້ານເຫຼົ້າແວງຂອງພວກເຮົາພາທ່ານຢ້ຽມຊົມຫ້ອງເກັບເຫຼົ້າແວງທີ່ສວຍງາມ, ເຊິ່ງເຕັມໄປດ້ວ"
"ຍເຫຼົ້າແວງຫາຍາກຊັ້ນຍອດ ເພື່ອເຕີມເຕັມຄ່ຳຄືນອັນແສນວິເສດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Then empty the fiscal position so that the tax applies regardless of your "
"customer's fiscal position."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນປະຊ່ອງສະຖານະທາງອາກອນໃຫ້ຫວ່າງໄວ້ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ອາກອນດັ່ງກ່າວ "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບສະຖານະທາງອາກອນຂອງລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Then set the days during which you want to prevent check in and check out to "
"take place, ex. All days but Saturday"
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນກຳນົດມື້ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ມີການແຈ້ງເຂົ້າພັກ ແລະ ແຈ້ງອອກ, ເຊັ່ນ: ທຸກມື້ຍົກເວັ້ນວັນເສົາ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"These all go free in your current subscription; feel free to explore! 🙃"
msgstr "ທັງໝົດນີ້ແມ່ນໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຟຣີໃນແພັກເກດສະມາຊິກປະຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານ; ເຊີນທົດລອງສຳຫຼວດໄດ້ເລີຍ! 🙃"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"They as well share the same pricing, defined at the stay offer level, which "
"has its pros and cons."
msgstr "ພວກມັນຍັງໃຊ້ລາຄາດຽວກັນ ເຊິ່ງກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນລະດັບຂໍ້ສະເໜີບ່ອນພັກ, ເຊິ່ງມີທັງຂໍ້ດີ ແລະ ຂໍ້ເສຍ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "They were happy about their stay, let's ask them to leave a review."
msgstr "ແຂກມີຄວາມສຸກກັບການພັກເຊົາຂອງພວກເຂົາ, ລອງເຊີນຊວນໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາຂຽນຄຳຕິຊົມກັນເທາະ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This blocks simulataneously all resources related to this working schedule "
"during the prescribed period."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປິດກັ້ນທຸກຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຕາຕະລາງການເຮັດວຽກນີ້ພ້ອມກັນ ໃນຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "This capability is enabled by a setting you can set/unset."
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດ/ປິດໄດ້."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This configuration step may be required to avoid any tax collection "
"inconsistency."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ອາດມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນ ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງຄວາມບໍ່ສອດຄ່ອງໃນການເກັບອາກອນ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This setup can be used for all products that must keep local tax rates (e.g. "
"late check-in)."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບທຸກສິນຄ້າທີ່ຕ້ອງຮັກສາອັດຕາອາກອນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (ເຊັ່ນ: ການແຈ້ງເຂົ້າພັກຊ້າ)."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This setup is relevant in case of place specific offers or when pricing "
"varies between places."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເໝາະສົມໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີຂໍ້ສະເໜີສະເພາະແຕ່ລະສະຖານທີ່ ຫຼື ເມື່ອລາຄາແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນແຕ່ລະບ່ອນ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This time, simply leave a note about the why this is booked and save the "
"slot."
msgstr "ຮອບນີ້, ພຽງແຕ່ຂຽນບັນທຶກເຫດຜົນວ່າເປັນຫຍັງຈຶ່ງມີການຈອງ ແລ້ວບັນທຶກຊ່ອງເວລາໄວ້."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.view_page_home
msgid "Three Michelin star restaurant"
msgstr "ຮ້ານອາຫານລະດັບ 3 ດາວມິດຊະລິນ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "To benefit from this capability, activate the corresponding setting."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.view_page_wellness
msgid ""
"To preserve the relaxation and privacy of all our guests, please turn off "
"your cell phones, cameras, and all other electronic devices upon entering "
"the spa."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮັກສາຄວາມສະຫງົບ ແລະ ຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວຂອງແຂກທຸກທ່ານ, ກະລຸນາປິດໂທລະສັບມືຖື, ກ້ອງຖ່າຍຮູບ ແລະ ອຸ"
"ປະກອນເອເລັກໂຕຣນິກອື່ນໆ ທັງໝົດ ເມື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ສະປາ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
